error[NK2305]: `self` is read here, but `use_it` changes it in the same call.
   --> tests/lend_field_view_to_mut_self_method.nika:24:12
    |
 24 | 				return self.use_it(f)
    |            ^^^^ `use_it` changes `self` and is handed a view into it
    |
    = note: `use_it` changes `self`, which it is called on, for the whole call, so no argument it borrows reads `self`.
    = help: Hand `use_it` a copy: `f.clone()`.
1 change to data a view still to be used may point into
